{
 "title": "函数",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "想把一项工作写一次、用很多次，就要定义**函数**。它以 `fn` 开头，带有名字和圆括号。`main` 也是函数；其他函数由 `main` 内部调用。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn greet():",
    "    print(\"Hello!\")",
    "    print(\"Welcome.\")",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    greet()",
    "    greet()"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "Hello!",
    "Welcome.",
    "Hello!",
    "Welcome."
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "函数可以接收信息（**参数**），也可以返回结果（`return`）。参数的类型写在 `:` 之后，返回类型写在 `->` 之后。`i32` 是整数类型；类型会在下一章学习。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn twice(x: i32) -> i32:",
    "    return x * 2",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(twice(21))"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "42"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c00-l05-x1",
   "prompt": "补全函数 `square`：它要返回收到的数字的平方（这个数字乘以它自己）。",
   "starter": [
    "fn square(x: i32) -> i32:",
    "    return 0",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(square(9))"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn square(x: i32) -> i32:",
    "    return x * x",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    print(square(9))"
   ],
   "hint": "把 `return 0` 换成 `return x * x`。",
   "expected": [
    "81"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c00-l05-q1",
   "q": "哪个词能从函数中返回结果？",
   "options": [
    "give",
    "return",
    "print"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "`return` 把值送回给调用者；`print` 只是把内容写到屏幕上。"
  }
 ]
}
